<title>MEXICO: 23 Mexican ports closed due to bad weather - report.</title>
<headline>23 Mexican ports closed due to bad weather - report.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cold front forced Mexican officials to close 23 ports on the Gulf of Mexico coast on Tuesday, state-owned news agency Notimex said.</p>
<p>Ports in the states of Veracruz, Tabasco and Campeche were shut to all types of shipping, the news agency said. It did not detail which ports were closed.</p>
<p>Earlier, the Mexican Communications and Transport Ministry said two of Mexico's three main crude shipping ports, Pajaritos and Dos Bocas, remained closed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
